@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #63527B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam classBorderColor #B3A3CB
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam componentBorderColor #B3A3CB
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam stateBorderColor #B3A3CB
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam activityBorderColor #B3A3CB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F7F4FC
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C4BBCF
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D9C69A
skinparam titleFontSize 22
hide empty members
title 栖物 · 双方确认与唯一成交
actor "买家 / 卖家" as User
boundary "预约详情" as UI
control "confirm_handover" as Service
database "SQLite" as DB
User -> UI : 确认收货或确认交易完成
UI -> Service : 预约 ID 和当前账号
Service -> DB : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
Service -> DB : 查询当事人的最新预约和商品
alt 已完成重试，或本方已经确认
  Service -> DB : 读取已有状态
  Service --> UI : 显示已有结果
else 最先确认的一方
  Service -> DB : 保存本方确认时间及通知
  Service -> DB : COMMIT
  Service --> UI : 等待另一方
else 最后确认的一方
  Service -> DB : 预约已完成，商品已售出
  Service -> DB : 写唯一成交、通知、审计\n清理联系方式
  Service -> DB : COMMIT
  Service --> UI : 显示成交
else 预约不可处理或写入失败
  Service -> DB : ROLLBACK
  Service -> DB : 事务外写失败审计
  Service --> UI : 显示错误
end
note over Service, DB
  待交接预约方可接受新确认
  成交价取预约时的金额快照
end note

@enduml
